    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711920/extras/6905234e4bbc51d5cec03cfdb36adf50.webp?t=1753529104\" width=616 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A city of countless possibilities \u2014 well, on paper at least... Because in reality, this is a place like any other, ahem, an average city. People are living their lives \u2014 and now you can be a part of it. Drive them around in a taxi, learn their stories, and cash in. You're not a charity, and car maintenance is pricey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711920/extras/126fefe07a8e9706dfdc4cdc847d3aff.poster.avif?t=1753529104\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711920/extras/126fefe07a8e9706dfdc4cdc847d3aff.webm?t=1753529104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711920/extras/126fefe07a8e9706dfdc4cdc847d3aff.mp4?t=1753529104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classy story</strong>   <br>Your passengers aren\u2019t lifeless cargo \u2014 they\u2019re human beings, living their lives. And you\u2019ve got a chance to learn a bit more about them.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A big Average City</strong>   <br>An open world where the sky\u2019s the limit? Not this time. It\u2019s a top-down 2D game \u2014 no sky\u2026 and the water\u2019s the limit, which you can\u2019t cross.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taxi maitenance</strong>   <br>Upgrade and repair your trusty taxi using the cash you\u2019ve earned. Keep it clean and (blood)stain-free.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements</strong>   <br>There are achievements \u2014 because why not? Even if you don\u2019t like the game, at least you\u2019ll earn some achievement points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic main character</strong><br>Who wouldn't want to be this handsome devil, am I right?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711920/extras/a05727a9b49483d43861e95f9c188a09.avif?t=1753529104\" width=616 height=337 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711920/extras/6905234e4bbc51d5cec03cfdb36adf50.webp?t=1753529104\" width=616 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A city of countless possibilities \u2014 well, on paper at least... Because in reality, this is a place like any other, ahem, an average city. People are living their lives \u2014 and now you can be a part of it. Drive them around in a taxi, learn their stories, and cash in. You're not a charity, and car maintenance is pricey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711920/extras/126fefe07a8e9706dfdc4cdc847d3aff.poster.avif?t=1753529104\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711920/extras/126fefe07a8e9706dfdc4cdc847d3aff.webm?t=1753529104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711920/extras/126fefe07a8e9706dfdc4cdc847d3aff.mp4?t=1753529104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classy story</strong>   <br>Your passengers aren\u2019t lifeless cargo \u2014 they\u2019re human beings, living their lives. And you\u2019ve got a chance to learn a bit more about them.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A big Average City</strong>   <br>An open world where the sky\u2019s the limit? Not this time. It\u2019s a top-down 2D game \u2014 no sky\u2026 and the water\u2019s the limit, which you can\u2019t cross.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taxi maitenance</strong>   <br>Upgrade and repair your trusty taxi using the cash you\u2019ve earned. Keep it clean and (blood)stain-free.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements</strong>   <br>There are achievements \u2014 because why not? Even if you don\u2019t like the game, at least you\u2019ll earn some achievement points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic main character</strong><br>Who wouldn't want to be this handsome devil, am I right?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711920/extras/a05727a9b49483d43861e95f9c188a09.avif?t=1753529104\" width=616 height=337 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Have you ever wondered what a day in the life of an average taxi driver looks like? Yes? No? Well, it doesn\u2019t matter. Now you can find out what it\u2019s like to drive average people around Average City. Complete missions, earn cash, and upgrade your taxi.",
